---
import DocPage from './DocPage.astro';
import { useT, localizePath, type Locale } from '../../i18n/ui';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, CONTACT_WECHAT, REPO_URL } from '../../lib/site';
import { getManifest } from '../../lib/data-server';
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const tr = useT(locale);
const zh = locale === 'zh-Hant' || locale === 'zh-Hans';
const manifest = getManifest();
const report = `mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(tr('report.subject'))}&body=${encodeURIComponent(tr('report.body', { url: Astro.url.href }))}`;
const ORGS = [
  {
    name: 'UNHCR, the UN Refugee Agency',
    url: 'https://donate.unhcr.org/',
    note: 'Mandated protection and assistance for refugees, asylum-seekers, stateless persons and many IDPs.',
    note_zh: '受權責保護與協助難民、庇護申請者、無國籍者及許多境內流離失所者。',
  },
  {
    name: 'Médecins Sans Frontières (MSF) 無國界醫生',
    url: 'https://www.msf.org/donate',
    note: 'Medical care in conflict zones and displacement sites.',
    note_zh: '在衝突地區與流離失所營地提供醫療照護。',
  },
  {
    name: 'International Rescue Committee (IRC)',
    url: 'https://www.rescue.org/',
    note: 'Emergency response and long-term support for displaced people.',
    note_zh: '為流離失所者提供緊急應變與長期支持。',
  },
  {
    name: 'Norwegian Refugee Council (NRC)',
    url: 'https://www.nrc.no/',
    note: 'Shelter, legal aid, education, food security for displaced people.',
    note_zh: '提供庇護所、法律協助、教育與糧食安全。',
  },
  {
    name: 'Danish Refugee Council (DRC)',
    url: 'https://drc.ngo/',
    note: 'Protection and durable solutions in 40+ countries.',
    note_zh: '在 40 多國推動保護與持久解決方案。',
  },
  {
    name: 'Global Refugee-led Network (GRN)',
    url: 'https://www.globalrefugeenetwork.org/',
    note: 'A network led by refugees themselves, advocating for refugee participation in the decisions that affect them.',
    note_zh: '由難民自身領導的全球網絡，倡議讓難民參與影響他們的決策。',
  },
];
---

<DocPage
  locale={locale}
  title={tr('page.about.title')}
  lede={zh
    ? '「他們去了哪裡」是一個獨立、非商業的資料平台，讓被迫流離失所的公開統計易於查看、檢驗、引用與再利用。'
    : 'Where They Went is an independent, non-commercial data platform that makes the published statistics on forced displacement easy to see, check, cite and reuse.'}
>
  <h2>{zh ? '這是給誰用的' : 'Who it is for'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh
        ? '任何需要可查證數字的人——寫作、研究、教學、倡議，或單純想確認一件事的讀者。不限定身分。成功的定義是被引用、被使用——而不是流量。這個順序決定了每一項設計：引用正確性優先，其次是方法論的完整、資料品質、連結的穩定，最後才是視覺效果。'
        : 'Anyone who needs a checkable number — for writing, research, teaching, advocacy, or simply to verify something. No credentials required. Success means being cited and reused — not page views. That order drives every decision: citation accuracy first, then a complete methodology, then data quality, then stable links, then visuals.'
    }
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '本站不是什麼' : 'What it is not'}</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      {
        zh ? (
          <>
            <strong>本站不追蹤任何個人。</strong>
            流離失所者是受迫害的人群；公開個別位置或身分可能使其家人遭到報復、或使庇護申請被駁回。本站只處理
            UNHCR、IDMC 與聯合國發布的群體層級統計——這是不可協商的底線。
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <strong>It does not track people.</strong> Displaced people are a persecuted population;
            publishing individual locations or identities can expose their families to reprisals or
            jeopardise asylum claims. This site only ever handles group-level statistics published
            by UNHCR, IDMC and the UN — and that is non-negotiable.
          </>
        )
      }
    </li>
    <li>
      {
        zh ? (
          <>
            <strong>本站不為流離失所者募款。</strong>
            想捐助流離失所者，請直接透過下方列出的組織——本站不經手任何善款、不收取任何推薦費。站方營運的自願贊助另見
            <a href={localizePath('/support', locale)}>支持本站</a>，兩者嚴格分開。
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <strong>It does not fundraise for displaced people.</strong> To give to displaced
            people, go directly to the organisations listed below — no charitable money passes
            through this site, and no referral fees are taken. Voluntary sponsorship of the site's
            own upkeep is a separate thing entirely: see{' '}
            <a href={localizePath('/support', locale)}>Support this site</a>.
          </>
        )
      }
    </li>
    <li>
      {
        zh ? (
          <>
            <strong>本站不追蹤你。</strong>沒有分析工具、沒有 Cookie、沒有第三方腳本。底圖瓦片來自
            OpenFreeMap；資料與程式皆為靜態檔案。
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <strong>It does not track you.</strong> No analytics, no cookies, no third-party
            scripts. The basemap tiles come from OpenFreeMap; the data and code are served as static
            files.
          </>
        )
      }
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>{zh ? '是誰在做、怎麼維持' : 'Who makes this'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          由 <strong>Lakkev</strong>（lakkev.com）獨立維護，無外部經費，營運成本為每月 0
          元（靜態架站 +
          免費層服務）。每一份發布的資料快照都提交至版本庫——即使本站有一天消失，所有數字仍可取回、仍可驗證。聯絡：
          <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>（微信：
          <code>{CONTACT_WECHAT}</code>）。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Independently maintained by <strong>Lakkev</strong> (lakkev.com). No external funding;
          hosting cost is $0/month (static site + free tiers). Every published data snapshot is
          committed to a version-controlled repository — even if this site ever disappears, every
          number remains retrievable and verifiable. Contact:{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> (WeChat:{' '}
          <code>{CONTACT_WECHAT}</code>).
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <h3>{zh ? '如果有一天停止維護' : 'If maintenance ever stops'}</h3>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          存續計畫是公開的，不依賴任何承諾：程式碼與每日資料快照都在公開版本庫（MIT
          授權，任何人可原樣重新架設）；季度資料束存於 Zenodo（CERN 營運，DOI
          永久有效）；整個版本庫另由 Software Heritage
          長期典藏。網址結構是穩定介面的一部分——既有連結與資料路徑（<code>/data/v1/</code>
          ）不會被改動或移除，只會新增。也就是說：本站最壞的結局是「凍結」，而不是「消失」。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          The succession plan is public and depends on no promise: the code and every daily data
          snapshot live in a public repository (MIT — anyone can redeploy the site as-is); quarterly
          data bundles are archived on Zenodo (CERN-run, DOIs resolve permanently); and the whole
          repository is independently preserved by Software Heritage. The URL structure is part of
          the stable interface — existing links and data paths (<code>/data/v1/</code>) are only
          ever added to, never changed or removed. The worst case for this site is “frozen”, not
          “gone”.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '資料、授權與程式碼' : 'Data, licences and code'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          <strong>資料是開放的</strong>：依原始開放授權轉載（UNHCR CC BY 4.0、IDMC CC BY-IGO、UN WPP
          CC BY 3.0 IGO、Natural Earth
          公有領域），出處標註隨每個下載檔內嵌。本站自身的程式碼以 MIT 授權開源（
          <a href={REPO_URL} rel="noopener">
            版本庫
          </a>
          ）。目前資料快照：<code>{manifest?.snapshot_id ?? '—'}</code>。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <strong>The data is open</strong>: reproduced under its original open licences (UNHCR CC
          BY 4.0, IDMC CC BY-IGO, UN WPP CC BY 3.0 IGO, Natural Earth public domain), with
          attribution embedded in every download. The site's own code is open source under the MIT licence (
          <a href={REPO_URL} rel="noopener">
            repository
          </a>
          ). Current data snapshot: <code>{manifest?.snapshot_id ?? '—'}</code>.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p>
    {zh ? '請參閱' : 'Read the'}
    <a href={localizePath('/methodology', locale)}>{zh ? '方法論' : 'methodology'}</a>{
      zh ? '、' : ', the '
    }<a href={localizePath('/about/boundaries', locale)}
      >{zh ? '邊界與名稱政策' : 'boundaries & names policy'}</a
    >{zh ? '與' : ', and the '}<a href={localizePath('/data', locale)}
      >{zh ? '資料下載中心' : 'download centre'}</a
    >{zh ? '。' : '.'}
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '回報問題' : 'Report a problem'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          每個頁面都有「回報問題」連結，會自動帶入您當下的檢視網址。或直接寄信至{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> —{' '}
          <a href={report}>開啟預填的回報信</a>
          。請附上「分享」按鈕產生的連結，並盡可能附上您預期的數字與其出處。追溯到上游來源的錯誤會回報給上游；本站管線的錯誤會修正並記錄於{' '}
          <code>docs/data-verification.md</code>。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Every page has a "Report a problem" link that pre-fills the current view. Or write to{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> —{' '}
          <a href={report}>open a pre-filled report</a>. Please include the share link of the view
          and, if you can, the number you expected and where it is published. Data errors that trace
          back to an upstream source are reported upstream; errors in our pipeline are fixed and
          logged in <code>docs/data-verification.md</code>.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '與流離失所者同行的組織' : 'Organisations working with displaced people'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          本站不為流離失所者募款、不經手任何善款，<strong>也不收取推薦費——並承諾永不收取</strong>
          ；若此政策有任何改變，本頁會在任何連結變動之前先行說明。以下組織直接與流離失所者工作；每個連結都通往
          <em>它們自己的</em>頁面，且各自公布經審計的財務報告。請注意：本站的主要資料來源即為
          UNHCR。獨立評鑑可參考{' '}
          <a href="https://www.charitynavigator.org/" rel="noopener">
            Charity Navigator
          </a>{' '}
          與{' '}
          <a href="https://www.givewell.org/" rel="noopener">
            GiveWell
          </a>
          （兩者皆為美國評鑑機構，其方法對全球南方組織相對不利）。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          This site does not fundraise for displaced people, routes no charitable money, and{' '}
          <strong>receives no referral fees — and commits to never accepting them</strong>; if that
          ever changes, this page will say so before any link changes. The organisations below work
          directly with displaced people; each link goes to <em>their own</em> page, and each
          publishes audited financial reports. Disclosure: UNHCR is also the primary source of the
          data on this site. Independent evaluations:{' '}
          <a href="https://www.charitynavigator.org/" rel="noopener">
            Charity Navigator
          </a>{' '}
          and{' '}
          <a href="https://www.givewell.org/" rel="noopener">
            GiveWell
          </a>{' '}
          (both US-based raters whose methods can disadvantage Global-South organisations).
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <ul>
    {
      ORGS.map((o) => (
        <li>
          <a href={o.url} rel="noopener">
            {o.name}
          </a>{' '}
          — <span class="small muted">{zh ? o.note_zh : o.note}</span>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
  <p class="small muted">
    {
      zh
        ? '列出僅供參考，不代表背書或合作關係。'
        : 'Listing here is informational, not an endorsement or a partnership.'
    }
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '維運' : 'Maintenance'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          資料管線每日自動執行並具備優雅降級：任一來源故障時，前一份快照持續上線並顯示提示。
          <strong>關於 AI 的使用</strong>
          ：資料管線是決定性的程式碼——沒有任何模型生成、推估或修改過任何數字；每個數字都能逐位元組追溯到
          UNHCR、IDMC 或聯合國的原始發布（見方法論頁與 <code>sources.json</code>
          ）。AI 只用於協助維護程式碼與文件，其產出一律經過自動驗證（每日 21 項自動檢查，其中 15 條為資料不變量）與版本庫審計。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          The pipeline runs automatically every day and degrades gracefully: if a source is
          unavailable, the previous snapshot stays online and a notice appears.{' '}
          <strong>On the use of AI</strong>: the data pipeline is deterministic code — no model has
          generated, estimated or modified any number; every figure is traceable byte-for-byte to
          the original UNHCR, IDMC or UN release (see the methodology page and{' '}
          <code>sources.json</code>). AI assists only with maintaining the code and documentation,
          and its output always passes automated validation (21 daily automated checks, 15 of them data invariants) and the
          repository's audit trail.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
</DocPage>
